source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira lifts even an unknown macro whose name carries a space out of the paragraph and refuses the span; jiro keeps the braces in the code body, without a warning because macro consumption is outside the Text Effect, citation, link and text-changing autolink set this conversion reports.
-- input.jira --
{{a {b c} d}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{a </p>
{b c}
<p> d}}</p>
-- want.md --
`a {b c} d`
-- warnings.json --
[]
